# verify-delegation

Apply the verify-delegation skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- decompose delegated work into a canonical delegation brief
- verify a delegated artifact against its success criteria without implementation context
- return a bounded DelegationVerdict with evidence, negative tests, and suite status

Stop when: Every declared success criterion is re-checked against the artifact with evidence, negative tests were run, and a bounded DelegationVerdict plus artifact reference is returned to the caller.
